OL,3,CWorld Cup play off draw: Wales to play
OL,4,CBosnia and Herzegovina in Cardiff
OL,6,FWales will host Bosnia and Herzegovina
OL,7,Fin the World Cup qualifying play-off
OL,8,Fsemi-finals in Cardiff.
OL,10,FJust two home matches now stand
OL,11,Fbetween Wales and qualification for
OL,12,Fnext year's World Cup.
OL,14,FAt a draw in Zurich on Thursday
OL,15,Fafternoon (November 20), the play-off
OL,16,Fpath that Craig Bellamy's side will
OL,17,Fhave to navigate to reach the global
OL,18,Fgathering was confirmed.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/3
