OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1764335141
OL,3,CWorld Cup play off draw: Wales to play
OL,4,CBosnia and Herzegovina in Cardiff
OL,6,FAfter their 7-1 thumping of North
OL,7,FMacedonia earlier this week, Wales
OL,8,Ffinished second in their qualifying
OL,9,Fgroup behind Belgium.
OL,11,FThe result guaranteed Wales a home
OL,12,Fsemi-final and today it was confirmed
OL,13,Fthat their opponents on March 26 will
OL,14,Fbe Bosnia and Herzegovina.
OL,16,FShould Wales win that match then they
OL,17,Fwould be one game away from qualifying
OL,18,Ffor the World Cup.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/3
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
