PN,31603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1764335141
OL,3,CWorld Cup play off draw: Wales to play
OL,4,CBosnia and Herzegovina in Cardiff
OL,6,FIn the play-off final on March 31,
OL,7,Fthey would face the winner of Italy v
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland and, crucially, that
OL,9,Fgame would also take place at the
OL,10,FCardiff City Stadium thanks to a
OL,11,Frandom draw.
OL,13,FIt's a huge boost for Bellamy's
OL,14,Fcharges, who will have a raucous crowd
OL,15,Fbehind them on what could be two huge
OL,16,Fnights for Welsh football.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/3
